flowchart TD
    Req([AI task request]) --> CLI{claude whoami\nexit 0?}
    CLI -->|yes| UseSession[Use CLI active session\nno credential passed to subprocess]
    CLI -->|no| Token{_connections token\nnon-empty?}
    Token -->|yes| InjectToken[Inject ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\nas env var in subprocess]
    Token -->|no| EnvVar{Env var set?\nANTHROPIC_API_KEY}
    EnvVar -->|yes| InjectEnv[Pass env var to subprocess]
    EnvVar -->|no| Fail([501 Not Configured])
    UseSession --> Spawn[spawn CLI in allow-listed env]
    InjectToken --> Spawn
    InjectEnv --> Spawn